# Phase 09 — throwaway probe source (deleted from the repo after the run)

Run as: npx playwright test --config=.probe-tmp/probe.config.ts --project=<probe-anon|probe-profile>
The whole .probe-tmp/ directory was removed afterwards; nothing of it is committed.

